    "title": "Critical fire weather threatens 3 states on Friday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By David Kesiena ,\n8 hours ago Why is Sheridan County under a red flag warning, and what should residents do? Forecasters say a mix of dry air, unseasonably warm temperatures and strong winds will make wildfires start easily and become hard to control on Friday, Oct. 23. The warning runs from noon to 9 p.m. MDT, and fire restrictions remain in effect across the county. Read full article",
